{"ref":"BDB, נֶ֫כֶס","hw":"נֶ֫כֶס","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">נֶ֫כֶס</span>]</big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup>Jos 22:8</sup> only pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">נְכָסִים</span> <strong>riches, treasures (</strong>prob. Assyrian or Aramaic loan-word, cf. Assyrian <em>nikâsu</em>, <em>property, wealth, gain</em>, Dl<sup>HWB 463</sup>, Syriac <span dir=\"rtl\">ܢܶܟܵܣܶܐ</span> <em>wealth;</em>—<a data-ref=\"Joshua 22:8\" href=\"/Joshua.22.8\">Jos 22:8</a> (P), <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 1:11\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.1.11\">2 Ch 1:11</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 1:12\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.1.12\">12</a> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 6:2\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.6.2\">Ec 6:2</a> (all ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">עֹשֶׁר</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">כָּבוֹד</span>), <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 5:18\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.5.18\">5:18</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">עֹשֶׁר</span>)<strong>)</strong>.","next":"BDB, נָכַר","prev":"BDB, כִּילַי²"}